/-!
# The cut points of `Print_ErrorFormatIndex_Warning` (PLAN.md §M, M1)

The 14 cut points: the entry and where two ways meet. From each, the blocks up to the next cut points as one piece
(`W_*`, with its `Sp`, `c_*`): a block's straight-line code, then at its jump's exits the next block's condition, or `Q`
at a cut point or at an offset the proof does not go past (59, 74, 82, 136, 178, 190, 201, 209, 223, 254, 259, 274, 281;
the `ret`). `Wt` is the table of the cut points' conditions, `spAll` its `Sp`s, for `Seg.cfg`. Generated by
`tools/blk_gen.py`.
-/
